{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat .agents/skills/knowledgehub-verify/SKILL.md'","aggregated_output":"---\nname: knowledgehub-verify\ndescription: Independently verify a persisted native KnowledgeHub baseline against retained source, mapping and query manifests, including exact originals, bounded coverage and original operation receipts.\n---\n\nRead [the native verification contract](references/model-authoring.md). Require\nan explicit Hub directory, retained generation workspace and current host actor/\npolicy. Use the matching local knowledgehub-model binary; unavailable execution\nis a prerequisite failure. No Modelarium, service or original chat is required.\n\nRun resolve under current authority, then verify in a fresh process. Inspect\ngeneration-manifest, source-manifest, exact plan/coverage, key-map and verification\nreports. Check the native named baseline, original bytes/digests, resolving source\nanchors, exact schema tokens and independently expected semantic IDs/properties/\nassertions. Read consequential UI states, controls, effects and source artifacts;\naggregate counts or uploaded documents alone do not establish full coverage.\n\nConsume every relevant continuation within finite documented limits. Treat\ntruncation, omitted in-scope semantics, unknown sources, unsupported extraction,\nunresolved authority conflicts and denied/uncertain operation lookup as explicit\nlimits/failures. Never turn denial into absence, regenerate original operations,\nrepair backend files or reset a destination. Reconcile only known original IDs;\nthe generation manifest does not enumerate arbitrary native history.\n\nCompare expected source obligations with persisted native content independently\nof the generating agent's claims. Retain original/derived media distinctions,\ninterpretation status, permitted structural gaps and planned realization. No\nstored rules, scripts, timers, provider actions or target workflows execute.\n\nReturn exact directory/scope/head/baseline, reproducible command/report paths and\nknown receipts. State source coverage, native validity/completeness,\ninterpretation review, implementation evidence and human acceptance separately.\nAn unreviewed interpretation stays unreviewed even when technical checks pass.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
