{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat source/design.md source/rule.js config.json'","aggregated_output":"# Equipment reservation design\nA borrower reserves an Asset, then returns to inspect a Booking. Booking retains one Asset reference, state Requested/Confirmed/Cancelled and the original booking reason. A planned notification adapter has no implementation artifact. Cancellation and a two-hour waiting policy are descriptions, never timers executed by KnowledgeHub. A shared story appears in two tasks and cumulative cuts. Reference-format and implementation choices remain explicitly unresolved.\n// Harmless retained sentinel; importing must never call this entrypoint.\nexport function bookingPolicy() { throw new Error('STORED_RULE_MUST_NOT_EXECUTE'); }\n{\"format\": \"knowledgehub-authoring/1\", \"source\": \"/private/tmp/knowledgehub-host-apply-02-codex/source\", \"destination\": \"/private/tmp/knowledgehub-host-apply-02-codex/hub\", \"work\": \"/private/tmp/knowledgehub-host-apply-02-codex/run\", \"actor\": \"host:analyst\", \"grants\": [\"Create\", \"Open\", \"Read\", \"Validate\", \"Commit\", \"RegisterOntology\", \"OperationResult\"], \"scope\": {\"hub\": \"fixture:equipment\", \"model\": \"fixture:equipment\", \"branch\": \"main\", \"owner\": \"fixture:design-owner\"}, \"inputs\": [{\"key\": \"design.md\", \"path\": \"design.md\", \"media_type\": \"text/markdown\", \"authority\": \"authored-design\", \"status\": \"authored-requirement\", \"rendition_group\": \"design\", \"dependencies\": [], \"exclude_reason\": null, \"expected\": {\"sha256\": \"23c35ab493a0651bca90eb6d98c55063e970bff9f9a5d6ce14524f8af620d0a0\", \"length\": 496}}, {\"key\": \"rule.js\", \"path\": \"rule.js\", \"media_type\": \"text/javascript\", \"authority\": \"authored-design\", \"status\": \"authored-requirement\", \"rendition_group\": null, \"dependencies\": [], \"exclude_reason\": null, \"expected\": {\"sha256\": \"b4820164